  "description": "When Sa-Rang discovers a mysterious yellow umbrella left by her doorstep, she doesn't think much of it. But one rainy evening she opens her umbrella and is magically transported to Albia where she runs into two men, one of whom could potentially be her soulmate. Will Sa-Rang be able to find her true love in a foreign land on the other side of the globe?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
